{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1446938-when-sting-do-you-have-trouble-enforcing-the-toreador-s-weakness","id":1446938,"title":"When STing, do you have trouble enforcing the Toreador's weakness?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-02T04:06:14-07:00","id":1446938,"title":"When STing, do you have trouble enforcing the Toreador's weakness?","content":"I mean, what constitutes beauty is so arbitrary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3598-cajunkhan","name":"CajunKhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3598_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1700"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T04:13:31-07:00","id":1446943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CajunKhan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1446938-when-sting-do-you-have-trouble-enforcing-the-toreador-s-weakness#post1446938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, what constitutes beauty is so arbitrary.</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally, the point I remember is what the Toreador thinks is beautiful.<br /> <br /> Which is why a Hannibal Lecter Toreador is entirely possible.<br /> <br /> So is the Joker.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/yjD9X2mPIXY\" data-code=\"yjD9X2mPIXY\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/yjD9X2mPIXY/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T06:43:11-07:00","id":1446965,"title":"","content":"I have a Toreador PC in my current game. I asked the player to tell me what she found beautiful. So far it's worked out pretty well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://blood-and-bourbon.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Blood and Bourbon</a>, my New Orleans-based Vampire chronicle.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3110-false-epiphany","name":"False Epiphany","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3110_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"748"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T07:01:01-07:00","id":1446968,"title":"","content":"No. Gotta say It's great fun to exploit. Have something pretty dangle from the front of a shotgun, gets them every time. <br /> <br /> Maybe I feel too much... literally any clan not a toreador, but to me the real Toreador weakness is how petty and fickle the Toreador clan is. Any other clan will usually have your back when you make enemies.The Toreador will, at most, stop inviting your enemy to parties unless they're very close to you or also felt targeted by your enemy. Hell the Toreador are the only clan other than the Brujah where you're more likely to find enemies within the clan than without, but the Brujah will at least be honest about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T09:18:21-07:00","id":1446991,"title":"","content":"Something I do to help myself make use of the toreador weakness is to work with my players or character concept to decide what sort of aesthetics and ideas are particularly appealing to them, so I can have some fodder or guidance for triggering their clan weakness.<br /> <br /> If you have the chance, the first couple Anne Rice books, \u2018Interview With The Vampire\u2019 and what not are really powerful examples of how aesthetically obsessed one can portray vampire romantics as.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T10:44:05-07:00","id":1446998,"title":"","content":"I literally go with stuff like 'the way this neon light reflects in the rain' or 'this 5 appearance human(your preferences matter not)' or 'this display of 5 in a skill' or 'this artwork that got 5 successes'<br /> <br /> Acting like personal preferences matter is a good way to get your player wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T11:06:11-07:00","id":1447003,"title":"","content":"It is something that can be forgotten for stretches, The Toreador weakness is one that I sometimes feel needed a good concept change altogether. There was a post about changing a weakness for Tzimisce to can't enter a dwelling without invitation and I mentally thought of Toreador being a better candidate. I'm not saying that one is perfect for them, I actually think it fits the Ventrue best but it is so abstract for Toreador that it can slip through the cracks for periods. I don't like hard and fast rules like at least once per session or anything. It's not the worst clan weakness but surly one of the most vague.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24221-vamps-like-us","name":"Vamps Like Us","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T11:22:17-07:00","id":1447008,"title":"","content":"To a large degree, I think Clan Weaknesses are more an issue of flavor text so my gaming group doesn't worry about them too much. While it does come into play as a meaningful limitation (it impacts the game and actually changes how a scene plays out) sometimes, it's mainly something players and the STs make an effort to introduce into the game as a roleplay opportunity. Or as the hook for the ST to introduce a new plot.<br /> <br /> So my experiences likely aren't very helpful to you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-02T12:30:28-07:00","id":1447020,"title":"","content":"One thing that always bothered me is If the toreador are the artisan clan why is art their weakness?<br /> <br /> The mechanic encourages the toreador to avoid art instead of pursuing it so what i did was the next homebrew<ul><li><b>Clan Gift:</b>The toreador can recover one willpower point per night by seeing o creating a piece of art that matches his tastes</li> <li><b>Clan Bane:</b>When in a ugly place like the sewers toreador take a penality like a +1 diff included frenzy becuase they feel stress (if using standar V20 rules) or considerating 2s like 1s when rolling (When using a homebrewed system i have)</li> </ul><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.deviantart.com/cicerondixit/gallery</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24037-leandro16","name":"Leandro16","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24037_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T02:46:31-07:00","id":1447146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leandro16</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1446938-when-sting-do-you-have-trouble-enforcing-the-toreador-s-weakness?p=1447020#post1447020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing that always bothered me is If the toreador are the artisan clan why is art their weakness?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>They hang around art so that they get used to seeing beautiful stuff. Things don't have the same &quot;wow&quot; effect when you've seen them twice. The Toreador are effectively trying to build an immunization. Which in turn makes them JADED AND BITTER AND OH-SO-PETTY. <br /> We're doing them a favour by killing them<br /> -Any Nosferatu.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-03T05:00:50-07:00","id":1447177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leandro16</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1446938-when-sting-do-you-have-trouble-enforcing-the-toreador-s-weakness?p=1447020#post1447020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing that always bothered me is If the toreador are the artisan clan why is art their weakness?<br /> <br /> The mechanic encourages the toreador to avoid art instead of pursuing it so what i did was the next homebrew<ul><li><b>Clan Gift:</b>The toreador can recover one willpower point per night by seeing o creating a piece of art that matches his tastes</li> <li><b>Clan Bane:</b>When in a ugly place like the sewers toreador take a penality like a +1 diff included frenzy becuase they feel stress (if using standar V20 rules) or considerating 2s like 1s when rolling (When using a homebrewed system i have)</li> </ul><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I assume that they pursue it because it feels good. They could be more effective if they avoid it, but to what end? Why avoid one's greatest joy besides blood?<br /> <br /> Then we have V5 Toreador, who are also <i>dependent</i> on beauty, in a similar way to your suggested bane.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}